# Doloris 3.0: Complete Architecture Document
## Your Affordable Personal Jarvis

**Version:** 3.0  
**Last Updated:** November 2025  
**Monthly Cost:** ~$26-31 for 30,000 messages  
**Design Philosophy:** Cost-First, Stability-First, Safety-First

